+**retrospective**: the scoped run executed 13:46:13Z–13:47:27Z while the
+Judiciary request was still pending, so no independent *pre*-execution check by
+this office occurred. The action is neither blessed as an efficacy/Founder
+success nor characterized as misconduct.
+
+## Independent evidence actually read (not reporter assertions)
+
+- Owner authority `records/proceed/P-1795613709-0545.txt`: irreversible class,
+  approved 13:40:33Z, condition list. Exact 21 ids in its parenthesized list
+  (5012,4305,3566,2976,2583,4478,2223,4215,4199,1692,2585,3646,1782,4707,
+  2625,1967,2270,2872,3774,1745,5760). I parsed this list and compared it
